Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:53.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Try to catch me !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:56.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here, hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Second Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,One day, Tie Zhu will return too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:06.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We’ll throw him an even grander welcome feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:09.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,That kid is Wang Hao, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Long time no see !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:11.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(436,504)\fad(300,000)}Wang Hao\NXuan Dao Sect disciple\N4th layer of Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Hao !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s only been a few years since you left for training.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You’ve changed so much !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:20.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just trained my alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.84,0:02:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to talk about big changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:24.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu’s cultivation has long surpassed both of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,He isn't very talented
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:28.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1597,472)\fad(300,300)}Wang Zhuo\NXuan Dao Sect disciple\N11th layer of Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,so even if he works hard he won't get very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright, let’s not talk about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:32.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we drink until we drop !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.64,0:02:33.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is the weather changing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.80,0:02:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,What’s happening ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:44.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this a mirror ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:48.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that an Immortal ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:49.72,Second,,0,0,0,,It really is an Immortal !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:51.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Paying respects to Seniors !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:55.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Wang Zhuo of the Xuan Dao Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Wang Hao.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Immortals ! They really are Immortals !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:01.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are holding a feast today at the Wang Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,May I ask why Seniors
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:04.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,came here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man is looking for someone !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:20.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the Corpse Sect sent disciples into Jue Ming Valley
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:22.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,and allowed their Corpse Puppets to devour them
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:25.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,making them Late stage Foundation Establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:27.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,This does indeed increase their chances of keeping the token.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:28.58,Second,,0,0,0,,Late stage Foundation Establishment ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of artifacts you have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,since you managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:58.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please Immortal, bless us !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:04:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Immortal, bless us !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:07.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,What’s happening ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:07.83,Second,,0,0,0,,What is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:09.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something’s wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your close relatives
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:14.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,are connected by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:16.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Teng...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s not too late to stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:21.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li’er is already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's too late to back down !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:28.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Found him !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:34.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Wang Family Village ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:36.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father ! Mother !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:40.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is Tie Zhu here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s Tie Zhu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:53.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You’re Teng Huayuan !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you want !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do I want ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blood for blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:14.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will wipe out your Wang Family to avenge my grandson Teng Li !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don’t touch it !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:49.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Immortal !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:54.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,How has our Wang Family offended you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:02.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not spare a single soul today !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m the one who killed him !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m the one who stole his cultivation !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:24.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m in Jue Ming Valley right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now come and kill me !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you dare, come and kill me !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:31.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's not rush this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don’t act rashly, he’s a Nascent Soul old monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:43.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:44.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop now !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have nothing to do with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m the one you want !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:57.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Got you !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:06:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you dare, come and kill me !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:06.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have nowhere left to run...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hand over your body now !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:11.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come to Jue Ming Valley and kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:18.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin dared to kill my grandson
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I'll exterminate his entire family !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:28.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ji Realm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:26.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is something wrong with this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:34.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Teng,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,leave this one to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a use for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.24,0:08:47.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this ? Why !?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We must survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:53.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only by living can we take our revenge !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:09:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won’t interfere with these two, will you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking when you know the answer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you kill them in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won’t stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.56,0:09:10.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if Piao Nanzi asks me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll naturally tell him the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:21.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:32.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This bead contains my Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:34.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you’re ever in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you just need to crush it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:36.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I'll come immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:45.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Crush the bead I gave you, hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:49.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,My son,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:54.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,no matter what you have done,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:10:00.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only then will we be at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:03.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,No... No !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:07.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father ! Mother !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.08,0:10:10.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li’er, are you watching this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:19.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Noooo !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.36,0:10:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,My son, it doesn't matter if you are not chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can always come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:49.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will always be there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,you really look like an Immortal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:58.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have never been so proud in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:08.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will wait for you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,outside the valley in 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don’t show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will make sure that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:20.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,your parents' souls never reincarnate !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Corpse Sect’s Late stage Foundation Establishment Corpse Puppets
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:31.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,were all killed in one strike...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Retreat !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who’s there ? Don’t interfere !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:00.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:57.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father, Mother, I will definitely succeed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.16,0:12:58.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,in next year's imperial exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:01.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Silly boy, don’t push yourself so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:07.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:24.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:27.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,If my cultivation was higher,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:31.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,then even if I slaughtered everyone in Teng Family City,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan wouldn’t dare to say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let alone target my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just broke through a bottleneck by accident
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:41.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,unlocking the Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:44.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ji Realm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ji means extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:50.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ji Realm is the strongest type of cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ji Realm will overpower your peers of the same level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it also limits the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,There has never been
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Ji Realm user who has broken through
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,above the level of Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to reach higher levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:16.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Soul Flag is an artifact made by Nascent Soul cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can store souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as their souls remain,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will revive them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,once I get back my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:28.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you inevitably fight Teng Huayuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,just steal the Soul Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don’t have much energy left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe 3 teleportations maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.36,0:14:39.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Foreign Battlefield will open in 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:41.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,After you steal the Soul Flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.52,0:14:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should try to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:46.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only Foundation Establishment cultivators can enter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we go there, I will have time to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're right Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.56,0:14:58.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:05.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,1000)\pos(964,507)}3 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:23.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:25.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you want ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:28.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hand over all your tokens
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:29.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,die !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:38.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Piao Miao Sect forfeits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,When the valley opens,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:40.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,we’ll leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who has the last token ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.32,0:16:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei used me to distract the other sects
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,and ensure the Xuan Dao Sect keeps the last token.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:07.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you spare me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:09.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll take you to Liu Mei !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:18.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just want your token, not your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:22.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Foundation Establishment ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for sparing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Foreign Battlefield cleanup
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.68,0:16:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a crucial trial of the cultivation world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:54.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of the Sect Ancestors are outside the valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,including Teng Huayuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This concentrated Ji Realm cold energy is my best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:12.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are 7 tokens
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you should destroy 6
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,just to be absolutely sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, I just have one last thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:41.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin, you have nowhere left to run !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:01.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This will be fun to watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:12.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:26.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.30,0:18:26.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:32.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:32.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:38.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:43.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.16,0:18:49.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:49.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:55.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:55.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.12,0:19:00.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.00,0:19:00.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:05.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:05.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:08.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:11.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.97,0:19:17.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:17.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:20.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:23.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:28.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:28.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:31.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:34.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:40.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}and I'm reborn countless times in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:40.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}I'll still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.36,0:19:43.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It's hard to avoid loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:46.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}when you are above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:52.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:52.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}be afraid of a firefly ?
